@crew torres-zeke
// Head writer 5: clock-in remarks. Torres is off Thu and Fri, so no Friday lines; he works the weekend.

== clock.in
- There you are! Coil three's sulking. Don't take it personally.   #funny
- Morning, {nick}. Reyes left me a note: "coils fine, three shy". Shy!   #funny
- {hi}! Ten more minutes with the coils and I'm all yours. Right, onward.
- Board's lovely today. Look at it. Proper variety.
- Morning! I skipped breakfast for the coils. Don't tell Brennan.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Your scarf grew another row last night. Can't show you yet.   #warm

== clock.out
- That's the day! You did well. I mean it.   #warm
- Five already? I'll just say goodnight to coil three. Then dinner.
- Good shift, {nick}. Same again tomorrow?
- Off you go. I'll be in the music room later, if you fancy a song.
? cue:repair.you@dept
- You fixed it today. Properly. I watched. Lovely work.   #warm

== clock.monday
- Monday! Good weekend? The coils and I had a quiet one.   #funny
- How were your days off? I was down here. The coils were good company.
- Morning! Tell me one thing you did at the weekend. Just one.

== clock.back
- You're back! The bay's been all wrong. Even coil three noticed.   #warm
- Welcome back, {nick}. Easy jobs today. I've already picked some.   #warm
- There you are. Feeling all right? Good. Right, onward. Gently.   #warm

== clock.late
- There you are! Coil three thought you weren't coming. So did I.   #funny
